OL,3,GNEWSA'Shocking' 1940s and 50s litter
OL,4,Afound on beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two-era plaster tin lid and
OL,7,Fa 50-year-old plastic medicine bottle
OL,8,Ffrom Colombia are among the items
OL,9,Fcollected from beaches by litter
OL,10,Fpickers.
OL,12,FWeymouth and Portland Marine Litter
OL,13,FProject is marking its fifth year of
OL,14,Freducing litter and pollution on the
OL,15,FDorset coast and has been sharing some
OL,16,Fof its most surprising finds.
OL,18,FThe charity runs several initiatives,
OL,19,Fincluding cleaning the coastline
OL,20,Fbetween Osmington and Chickerell.
