OL,3,GNEWSA'Shocking' 1940s and 50s litter
OL,4,Afound on beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-founder Dave Taylor, who researches
OL,7,Fsome of the more interesting pieces of
OL,8,Flitter, said it had been "shocking" to
OL,9,Fsee how long plastic survived.
